  "content": "# 盔甲纹饰 - 色彩缤纷！\n\n在锻造台中为你的盔甲添加 **29种纹饰材料**！<br>\n受到 [Skottify](https://modrinth.com/user/Skottify) 的 [More Trim Colors](https://modrinth.com/datapack/more-trim-colors) 的极大启发！\n\n<br><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/K6FfrDg63Q\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/99d8e1537bdc422307a8e4c702cd2dec0b31c64a.png\" width=\"400\"></a> <br><i>如有疑问请加入 Discord 服务器！</i></p>\n<hr>\n<p align=\"center\"><em>（使用数据包版本时，请确保安装了所需的资源包，否则数据包无法正常运行！）</em><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/866b62cbc3eda0b0f7043edf4e35cc1b12248388.png\" alt=\"资源包下载指南\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<details>\n  <summary>所有新纹饰材料</summary>\n  <h2>1.21.4 及以上版本</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f724bc9407914c20aef04c1deaa5247ca14c40ed.png\" alt=\"鳞甲\"> 鳞甲</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e27954e374e57db722946ae8fdd4c99f5a7f0fe0.png\" alt=\"烈焰棒\"> 烈焰棒</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d88f8a4fe8030e4cadc88b1a925e4ace2d4e0413.png\" alt=\"蓝冰\"> 蓝冰</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f1f604e98c11b1b956ac5c3d00510afaf76b9307.png\" alt=\"旋风棒\"> 旋风棒</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/774d85b10267865ee18f360f340be5f64d2b58b2.png\" alt=\"哭泣的黑曜石\"> 哭泣的黑曜石</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b040d3ec03e29d14934885274a1c37c6290a6152.png\" alt=\"龙息\"> 龙息</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a652887165ef80d5aee453f1f15f492c7f2e8ec3.png\" alt=\"滴水石块\"> 滴水石块</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/72ef8fc6ae1f1baaab40ec59dd6924de8d451f7e.png\" alt=\"回响碎片\"> 回响碎片</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9eca7022de15e71849f879fe0a5c3f36ab9d7ffa.png\" alt=\"末地水晶\"> 末地水晶</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c2d509bd5f42e61ea73927657fb1ee267de7371e.png\" alt=\"末影珍珠\"> 末影珍珠</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc9605eedd8b8eb5dc1fb72f3db4b84fa1fbf199.png\" alt=\"恶魂之泪\"> 恶魂之泪</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c57de99c7649413d119e55b3e8eae4e68de77422.png\" alt=\"玻璃\"> 玻璃 <i>（清除纹饰）</i></li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c269b96c39de587922073133256df73584a4abf1.png\" alt=\"荧石粉\"> 荧石粉</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5d0726a93acd84c43a28d225d2b40b952a6a30c1.png\" alt=\"海洋之心\"> 海洋之心</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c847f288c3ca832fd5c662cdbb421700f3c9b1e.png\" alt=\"皮革\"> 皮革</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7b4787c7aed1d738aa070f48339738dc001ca487.png\" alt=\"岩浆膏\"> 岩浆膏</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6ca74675dd8c9e8d33ea94baceda100764039aa9.png\" alt=\"鹦鹉螺壳\"> 鹦鹉螺壳</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f770a646e3d5aa721420a06195768c3b30d0faad.png\" alt=\"下界之星\"> 下界之星</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f894f116d4486cc7f0a8f4174255e5967d31c8c3.png\" alt=\"下界疣\"> 下界疣</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ac5483efbd15a265bfd61c28d1b29ce5b4f202d.png\" alt=\"下界合金碎片\"> 下界合金碎片</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d87480d5ed773de1b05c2ca05293e46575910d0.png\" alt=\"黑曜石\"> 黑曜石</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7d9916159d3f54ea2c428e9f92c7f807ade1d00.png\" alt=\"幻翼膜\"> 幻翼膜</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/725824f3a3e467be1c7c621c72ae16719c9cf801.png\" alt=\"海晶碎片\"> 海晶碎片</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/468bdd915fda7881cf2365d767f3829e7c606c90.png\" alt=\"海晶砂粒\"> 海晶砂粒</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0cd8c9134829b9c9014bf41dd5eebf9d65315418.png\" alt=\"兔子皮\"> 兔子皮</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc4c7dd12c04da913c1776ae37b7631cbc614b93.png\" alt=\"玫瑰金\"> 玫瑰金</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/69e0a8f4af7c45929792bb81bbfe6a281526d08b.png\" alt=\"潜影壳\"> 潜影壳</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3aed45464d92e8d667f3b963de2206df50de4dae.png\" alt=\"粘液球\"> 粘液球</li>\n      <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51c8bbcdfda444c9ba214df675fc4630d494f708.png\" alt=\"海龟壳\"> 海龟壳</li>\n    </ul>\n  <h2>旧版本</h2>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f724bc9407914c20aef04c1deaa5247ca14c40ed.png\" alt=\"鳞甲\"> 鳞甲 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c4837669d61294e19fe120bc92922ded6137bed4.png\" alt=\"砖\"> <b>砖</b>（< 1.20.5）</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc4c7dd12c04da913c1776ae37b7631cbc614b93.png\" alt=\"玫瑰金\"> 玫瑰金 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4a3ffa2bb686c43173efb0f2f48b549dc85ee98.png\" alt=\"蜂蜜块\"> <b>蜂蜜块</b>（< 1.21）</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f3dcd13d1c4cfc5fa60c6d176204b24a9199d1e.png\" alt=\"树脂砖\"> 树脂砖 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c158431146787c8b98b954118eddac30ab3da10.png\" alt=\"岩浆块\"> <b>岩浆块</b>（< 1.21.4）</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f1f604e98c11b1b956ac5c3d00510afaf76b9307.png\" alt=\"旋风棒\"> 旋风棒 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/75bc6180d3da535b734cb0edf190f4bbfde81285.png\" alt=\"珠光蛙光体\"> <b>珠光蛙光体</b>（< 1.21）</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>玫瑰金合成配方</summary>\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47b3305b3b396c489b89feddeeb18ca811c943f6.jpeg\" alt=\"玫瑰金合成配方\"></p>\n  <p>（无序合成）</p>\n</details>\n<hr>\n<h2>该数据包兼容：</h2>\n<details>\n  <summary>兼容模组</summary><br>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/elytra-trims\">Elytra Trims</a><i>（KikuGie）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/elytra-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/352a7a2a433fd95cb619e8066d0c93ac98f192f6.png\" alt=\"Elytra Trims Logo\"></a> - （无物品纹理）<br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alexs-caves\">Alex's Caves</a><i>（AlexModGuy）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alexs-caves\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7423f750e5d7f8d58c0574834e5f6d9f18da1373.jpeg\" alt=\"Alex's Caves Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ancient-aether\">Ancient Aether</a><i>（Builderdog841）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ancient-aether\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/26e3bd5071cba4f02728285cc20db492baf1f3cb_0.webp\" alt=\"Ancient Aether Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/frostiful\">Frostiful</a><i>（TheDeathlyCow）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/frostiful\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c820ca41867564677535e9dab9afcc81002005e1.jpeg\" alt=\"Frostiful Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/geode-plus\">Geode+</a><i>（Team Chorus）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/geode-plus\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/392b223d19aaa24958964dbaa746157a1be6094d_0.webp\" alt=\"Geode+ Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-armor-trims\">More Armor Trims</a><i>（masik16u）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-armor-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2a23aa9fedc6117c5ba45bd64d6b00e1bb7e63e.jpeg\" alt=\"More Armor Trims Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-sniffer-flowers?version=1.20.1&loader=forge\">More Sniffer Flowers</a><i>（Nikdo53）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-sniffer-flowers?version=1.20.1&loader=forge\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1969e48ebed72cda4ac20259b7d94cac437517a2.jpeg\" alt=\"More Sniffer Flowers Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/tates-extra-trims\">TaTe's Extra Trims</a><i>（AverageTaTeMan）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/tates-extra-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c1f8a7648bcaa1abeb63ce51b0d9a7862ae49a0.jpeg\" alt=\"TaTe's Extra Trims Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n     <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/too-many-trims\">Too Many Trims</a><i>（Herobrine011840）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/too-many-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2450ea3cd876ffbe42d91d2e616bf69e68804116.gif\" alt=\"Too Many Trims Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/trims-expanded\">Trims Expanded</a><i>（Omniv）</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/trims-expanded\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0df45c329af4b9b0d4eef509083388bac0b5bc9f.jpeg\" alt=\"Trims Expanded Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</details>\n\n## 常见问题解答：\n### 问：为什么我在锻造台给盔甲添加纹饰时，配方上显示红色的“X”？\n**答**：首先，把纹饰材料丢到地上，再捡起来，然后尝试合成。如果问题仍然存在，请重启你的服务器。如果以上步骤均无法解决问题，请在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/K6FfrDg63Q\">Discord 服务器</a>或 GitHub 页面报告问题。\n\n### 问：为什么我无法将材料放入锻造台？\n**答**：如果尝试上述方法后问题仍然存在，请再次检查你是否正确安装了数据包。如果你确定数据包已正确安装，请在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/K6FfrDg63Q\">Discord 服务器</a>或 GitHub 页面报告问题。\n\n### 问：为什么所有配方都无法正常工作？\n**答**：你可能需要重启你的世界、服务器或领域。重启后配方应该能正常工作。\n\n### 问：我在使用该数据包时遇到了缺失纹理，如何修复？\n**答**：使用数据包版本时，你必须下载并安装所需的资源包。\n\n### 问：我在哪里可以找到并下载资源包？\n**答**：Modrinth 上的主要下载按钮只提供数据包，不包含资源包。你需要进入“版本”选项卡找到并下载资源包文件。（参见页面顶部的图片）\n\n特别感谢 [Lynx](https://modrinth.com/user/lynx-xdg) 协助生成文件！",
